msgid "Multiple controller ownership"
msgstr "多控制器所有权"

msgid ""
"The public I/O faces keep their existing operation tables and caller-owned "
"request contracts. Selecting another physical controller creates another "
"private provider instance, not another transport abstraction or global "
"registry. An instance's cold register, clock, DMA and IRQ facts remain "
"immutable until its publisher set has been withdrawn and the instance "
"stopped."
msgstr ""
"公共 I/O "
"接口面保持既有方法表与调用方持有的请求合同。选择另一个物理控制器会建立另一个私有提供者实例，而不是增加传输抽象或全局注册表。实例的冷态寄存器、时钟、DMA"
" 和 IRQ 事实在发布者集合撤销且实例停止前保持不可变。"

msgid "I2C V1 IRQ and finite DMA"
msgstr "I2C V1 IRQ 与有限 DMA"

msgid ""
"STM32F407 I2C1 and I2C2, and GD32F470 I2C0 and I2C1, execute the same "
"maintained V1 register algorithm. Per-controller cold wrappers validate all "
"register pointers, DATA offsets, line inputs, bus clocks and DMA selectors "
"against the actual SDK. Their EV, ER, RX DMA and TX DMA IRQs come from the "
"selected controller identity. Initialization of an already enabled physical "
"controller returns `BUSY` before changing its control registers or IRQ "
"priorities."
msgstr ""
"STM32F407 I2C1／I2C2 和 GD32F470 I2C0／I2C1 执行同一维护中的 V1 寄存器算法。各控制器的冷态包装使用真实 SDK"
" 校验寄存器指针、DATA 偏移、线路输入、总线时钟与 DMA 选择器。EV、ER、RX DMA 和 TX DMA IRQ "
"由所选控制器身份确定。初始化已使能的物理控制器时，在修改控制寄存器或 IRQ 优先级前返回 `BUSY`。"

