msgid ""
"GD32 names in this table are the vendor's literal DMA0/DMA1 names. The "
"platform configuration's opaque controller IDs use a separate mapping. A DMA"
" request selector never identifies or allocates a memory engine. Static cold"
" assembly must reject other devices that select an already owned physical "
"engine."
msgstr ""
"本表 GD32 名称使用厂商原始 DMA0／DMA1 命名。平台配置中的不透明控制器 ID 使用独立映射。DMA "
"请求选择器既不标识也不分配内存引擎。静态冷态装配必须拒绝其他器件选择已被占用的物理引擎。"

msgid ""
"Setting the private state's DMA descriptor to `NULL` selects IRQ-only "
"messages and acquires no DMA vector. Exact immutable macros "
"`NX_STM32_I2C2_DMA(regions, count)` and `NX_GD32_I2C1_DMA(regions, count)` "
"select the secondary finite routes. The initialization API is unchanged. "
"Pin, bus clock, DMA clock and shared resource leases remain cold assembly's "
"responsibility; the provider does not silently allocate these resources."
msgstr ""
"私有状态中的 DMA 描述符设为 `NULL` 时选择纯 IRQ 消息，不取得 DMA 向量。精确不可变宏 "
"`NX_STM32_I2C2_DMA(regions, count)` 和 `NX_GD32_I2C1_DMA(regions, count)` "
"选择第二组有限路由。初始化 API 不变。引脚、总线时钟、DMA 时钟和共享资源租约仍由冷态装配负责；提供者不会静默分配这些资源。"

msgid ""
"Each request retains its descriptor, messages, buffers and endpoint until "
"that controller's engine, interrupt sources and wire have drained. "
"Completing or cancelling one instance cannot acknowledge another stream's "
"W1C flags, disable its vectors, release its request or change its wake sink."
" A refused DMA disable retains only the affected instance's borrow in "
"`DRAINING` or `QUARANTINED`; elapsed time does not prove hardware "
"quiescence."
msgstr ""
"每个请求保留描述符、消息、缓冲区和端点，直到该控制器的引擎、中断源与线侧完成排空。一个实例的完成或取消不能确认另一 stream 的 W1C "
"标志、关闭其向量、释放其请求或改变其唤醒接收器。DMA 拒绝停止时，仅受影响实例的借用保留在 `DRAINING` 或 "
"`QUARANTINED`；时间流逝不能证明硬件静止。"

msgid ""
"The shared DMA acknowledge leaf compiles to a direct selected register "
"write. Its test override models the real W1C side effect rather than "
"treating a clear register as ordinary RAM. There is no per-byte MMIO "
"operation table or new mutable field. Actual Cortex-M4F compilation measures"
" the unchanged state at 56 bytes, endpoint at 8 bytes and optional immutable"
" DMA descriptor at 80 bytes. The provider and shared algorithm objects "
"contain zero global DATA/BSS. Selected object text size is evidence of a "
"compiled object, not an entire image's retained Flash size or a cycle "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"共享 DMA 确认叶子编译为直接写入所选寄存器。测试覆盖模拟真实 W1C 副作用，而不是把清除寄存器当普通 RAM。没有逐字节 MMIO "
"方法表或新增可变字段。真实 Cortex-M4F 编译测得不变状态为 56 字节、端点 8 字节、可选不可变 DMA 描述符 80 "
"字节。提供者与共享算法对象的全局 DATA/BSS 为零。选中对象的 text 大小只是编译对象证据，不代表完整镜像保留的 Flash 或周期测量。"

msgid ""
"The reviewed silicon route sources are STM32 RM0090 Rev22 Table 43 and "
"GD32F4xx User Manual Rev3.3 Tables 10-2 and 10-3. These facts do not "
"establish a board's external wiring. Secondary-board routes require an "
"explicit reviewed board configuration. Host tests model external CPU/MMIO "
"behavior, and real ARM compilation uses actual vendor SDK headers. Bus "
"timing, electrical levels and DMA contention still need hardware "
"qualification; no physical result is claimed here."
msgstr ""
"已审阅硅片路由来源为 STM32 RM0090 Rev22 表 43 和 GD32F4xx User Manual Rev3.3 表 "
"10-2／10-3。这些事实不能证明板级外部接线。第二控制器板级路由需要显式审阅配置。主机测试模拟外部 CPU/MMIO，真实 ARM 编译使用真实厂商"
" SDK 头文件。总线时序、电气电平和 DMA 争用仍需硬件资格；本页不声明物理结果。"
